# mcp-awareness CLA bypass allowlist.
#
# One GitHub login per line. Comments start with `#` and are ignored.
# Empty lines are ignored. Leading / trailing whitespace is trimmed.
#
# Consumed by .github/workflows/cla-bot-bypass.yml — when a PR is
# opened (or synchronized / reopened) by one of the logins below, the
# workflow posts `license/cla = success` to the PR head SHA. This
# mirrors the cla-assistant.io dashboard whitelist for the specific
# case where CLAassistant silently skips PRs that touch files under
# .github/workflows/** (its OAuth scope doesn't cover `workflow`, so
# reading the diff fails — PRs never get a status posted at all).
#
# Humans still go through the cla-assistant.io signing flow unchanged;
# this list is for automation accounts the maintainer controls.
#
# Authoritative source for human CLA status: https://cla-assistant.io
# Mirror (this file) covers bot authors only.

cmeans-claude-dev[bot]
dependabot[bot]
